{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-42","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与二项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"Let AB be a binomial straight line divided into its terms at C; therefore AC, CB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [X. 36 ]","book":10,"number":42,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":42,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","contentId":"euclid-10-42","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa399346169211a6edfbf68ad52cb5815d6bc6890bffd7653a0fb18efebaf53b","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-42.statement","euclid-10-42.proof.1","euclid-10-42.proof.2","euclid-10-42.proof.3","euclid-10-42.proof.4","euclid-10-42.proof.5","euclid-10-42.proof.6","euclid-10-42.proof.7","euclid-10-42.proof.8","euclid-10-42.proof.9","euclid-10-42.conclusion","euclid-10-42.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-42.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5768d27cc0cd460482a835a0463bca9edb94b994225bbccc8f065e6bfd540cb2","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AB be a binomial straight line divided into its terms at C; therefore AC, CB are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让AB成为按C线划分的二项无理线段直线;因此,AC,CB是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度 [ [X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b72f0ea0685c0077db6e667aac8be7e0746a5ad3f645eae6f021310d90ea52f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that AB is not divided at another point into two rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,AB没有在另一个时候被分为两个有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f43905f819473ac95013a5ef3816d401cc813bba4ac55ad04bba4a50488e4e28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be divided at D also, so that AD, DB are also rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,也让它分为D,AD,DB也是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"082000cc84971d2a6bb5068b571022a26ad69d553dbc40d5412035058d59fd23","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"It is then manifest that AC is not the same with DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此可见,DB起的AC起并不相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9cd9fa71c430da369ed027085a7ed1390c168e9ba854439edeb085ea60b3eb53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be so."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"可能的话,就让它这样吧"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"627ba85000e80cc942c18bfea2d76f780dd355b5896eee772746ae1be611a36b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then AD will also be the same as CB, and, as AC is to CB, so will BD be to DA; thus AB will be divided at D also in the same way as by the division at C: which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"于是 AD 也等于 CB，并且 AC 与 CB 之比等于 BD 与 DA 之比；因此，线段 AB 在 D 点的分割方式与在 C 点的分割方式相同，这与原假设矛盾。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eb2d52049bd69cfa73ec9781ad5cb0288690ebbfa68b72ddb2bf872059e1c45c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AC is not the same with DB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DB项与AC项不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"452d9e2ae97602308fdb50c84b4da259d341f20dc92d0c4ec61d3e154143b089","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For this reason also the points C, D are not equidistant from the point of bisection."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从两点来看,C、D点也不相等。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d68e95eb89bf683e2d1aaa5186583b579b6b9ccbbe62cc234467b35dfda18e7e","citations":["euclid-2-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore that by which the squares on AC, CB differ from the squares on AD, DB is also that by which twice the rectangle AD, DB differs from twice the rectangle AC, CB, because both the squares on AC, CB together with twice the rectangle AC, CB, and the squares on AD, DB together with twice the rectangle AD, DB, are equal to the square on AB. [[II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AC和CB的正方形和AD的正方形之间,DB也是矩形和AD的两倍,DB的两倍,矩形和CB的两倍,CB和矩形和CB的两倍,AD和DB的两倍,等于AB的正方形 [ [II. 4](/principles/euclid-2-4)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5eb7802c87aed60ce7e412198676f212aaa654108acc76cdbaa99ccbc7c269f4","citations":["euclid-10-21","euclid-10-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the squares on AC, CB differ from the squares on AD, DB by a rational area, for both are rational; therefore twice the rectangle AD, DB also differs from twice the rectangle AC, CB by a rational area, though they are medial [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21) ]: which is absurd, for a medial area does not exceed a medial by a rational area. [[x. 26](/principles/euclid-10-26) ]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AC,CB的正方形和AD,DB和有理面积的正方形有差异,因为两者均为有理;因此,矩形,AD,DB的两倍也与矩形,AC和有理面积的两倍不同,尽管是中项无理线段]:这是荒谬的,中项无理线段个区域不超过中项无理线段个有理面积 [ [ [X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21) [x. 26](/principles/euclid-10-26)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":10,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"85de9746992831befb750979df164d150cb641a95ba6aed9d0f9a2c0ddac59e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore a binomial straight line is not divided at different points; therefore it is divided at one point only. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,二项无理线段直线不在不同点上分割,因此只在一个点上分割。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-42.source","contentId":"euclid-10-42","revisionId":"euclid-10-42@raw-fa399346169211a6","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51376caaa4a909959a1a38c404ab14b51ea05432f6c71475d9e2dcf99c5cde34","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-10-36:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-42","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-42.statement"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-36","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42/","sourceLabel":"X. 36"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-2-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-42","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-42.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-2-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42/","sourceLabel":"II. 4"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-10-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-42","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-42.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42/","sourceLabel":"X. 21"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-10-26:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-42","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-42.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-26","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.42/","sourceLabel":"x. 26"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-47:euclid-10-42:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-47","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-47.proof.9"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-42","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.47/","sourceLabel":"X. 42"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-10-36:explicit","id":"euclid-10-36","book":10,"number":36,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：可公度量与二项无理线段与无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-2-4:explicit","id":"euclid-2-4","book":2,"number":4,"kind":"proposition","title":"完全平方公式的几何证明","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-10-21:explicit","id":"euclid-10-21","book":10,"number":21,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与中项无理线段与无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-42:euclid-10-26:explicit","id":"euclid-10-26","book":10,"number":26,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：中项无理线段与比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-10-47:euclid-10-42:explicit","id":"euclid-10-47","book":10,"number":47,"kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：中项无理线段","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-irrational","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
